rs used to extract seeds from magnetic resonance (MR) images</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-S129-i002"/></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Comparison of number of seeds obtained from CT and MR images</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-S129-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>CT, computerized tomography; MR, magnetic resonance.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Prostate volumes receiving 100% of prescribed dose. Dose calculations were based on the seed distribution obtained by the automated method from MR and CT</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-S129-i004"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>MR, magnetic resonance; CT, computerized tomography.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>